    <!-- About Photo Contests Section -->
    <div class="about-contests">
        <h2>About Our Photo Contests</h2>
        <p>
            At Photo Contest, we are passionate about celebrating the beauty and creativity found in photography. Every year, we host a variety of photo contests designed to inspire photographers of all levels. Our contests cover multiple categories, from nature and landscapes to portraits and street photography. We believe that photography is not just about capturing images, but about telling stories, sharing emotions, and evoking thoughts.
        </p>
        <p>
            Whether you're an amateur or a professional photographer, our contests provide the perfect platform to showcase your skills, gain exposure, and even win exciting prizes. Our team of expert judges reviews each submission based on creativity, composition, and impact. We're committed to promoting photography as an art form and giving photographers the recognition they deserve.
        </p>
        <p>
            Join us today, submit your photos, and be a part of our growing photography community. Who knows, your photo might be the next big winner!
        </p>
    </div>
</main>

